00:39:45.282 --> 00:39:47.351
the political coalitions
are going to shift again.

00:39:47.351 --> 00:39:49.854 align:start size:97% position:3%
But let's not lose the fight
that we're in right now

00:39:49.854 --> 00:39:51.389 align:start size:81% position:19%
because of the
hypothetical fight

00:39:51.389 --> 00:39:52.990
that we're going to
have in the future.

00:39:52.990 --> 00:39:55.726
- So what would you say
then to the conservatives

00:39:55.726 --> 00:39:58.295
