00:40:25.356 --> 00:40:28.359 align:start position:0%
I did not get any hate from
anyone on the right, by the way.

00:40:28.359 --> 00:40:29.760
- Of course.
- For this.

00:40:29.760 --> 00:40:31.729 align:start size:94% position:6%
