but it's all good."

00:40:40.337 --> 00:40:41.605
and most of them say
what you kind of said,

00:40:41.605 --> 00:40:43.140
which is, you'll get there.

00:40:43.140 --> 00:40:44.542
- You'll get there, we'll
get to it, don't worry.

00:40:44.542 --> 00:40:45.810
- Something like that, okay.

00:40:45.810 --> 00:40:47.344
But putting that aside,
I think there will be

00:40:47.344 --> 00:40:49.947
a certain set within that
that'll be like no, no, no,

00:40:49.947 --> 00:40:51.148
that's a bridge too far.

00:40:51.148 --> 00:40:52.850
And I think what's happening is,

00:40:52.850 --> 00:40:54.852 align:start size:84% position:16%
a lot of the
disaffected lefties,

00:40:54.852 --> 00:40:57.354 align:start size:84% position:16%
