00:41:03.360 --> 00:41:05.196 align:start size:94% position:6%
and keep them in the
closet on the other side.

00:41:05.196 --> 00:41:07.731
- Well one of the political
thinkers, Cardinal Manning,

00:41:07.731 --> 00:41:10.601 align:start size:84% position:16%
said, that at bottom,
all religious,

00:41:10.601 --> 00:41:12.536
or all political conflict,

00:41:12.536 --> 00:41:15.506 align:start size:88% position:13%
and all human conflict,
is theological.

00:41:15.506 --> 00:41:16.941 align:start size:84% position:16%
It comes down to
religious questions.

00:41:16.941 --> 00:41:18.576
And you know, St.
Andrew Breitbart,

00:41:18.576 --> 00:41:20.611 align:start size:88% position:13%
