00:41:27.952 --> 00:41:31.555 align:start size:88% position:13%
What a cultural worships
defines that culture.

00:41:31.555 --> 00:41:33.858
And so at the bottom you have
these religious questions.

00:41:33.858 --> 00:41:36.694 align:start size:88% position:13%
And some people write
off religious questions,

00:41:36.694 --> 00:41:38.329
and they say well
