00:41:54.912 --> 00:41:58.315 align:start size:84% position:16%
So, I would imagine
that years ago,

00:41:58.315 --> 00:42:01.118 align:start size:88% position:13%
you would have called
yourself more pro-choice

00:42:01.118 --> 00:42:02.152 align:start size:75% position:25%
than you do now.
- Oh yeah.

00:42:02.152 --> 00:42:03.387 align:start size:72% position:28%
- Certainly.
- Yeah.

00:42:03.387 --> 00:42:04.588
- You've come over and,

00:42:05.956 --> 00:42:10.327 align:start position:0%
