00:42:13.330 --> 00:42:14.665
That you, in my view,

00:42:14.665 --> 00:42:16.667 align:start size:88% position:13%
have become more correct
on that question.

00:42:16.667 --> 00:42:19.003 align:start size:97% position:3%
- Well, I always tell Ben when
