out of people's
lives, and then we can

00:42:48.232 --> 00:42:49.700
talk about life and all that.

00:42:51.135 --> 00:42:54.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
But that, so I think I
get your conclusion there.

00:42:54.672 --> 00:42:55.940
Because it's like, all right,

00:42:55.940 --> 00:42:57.241 align:start size:81% position:19%
we can at least
do something here.

00:42:57.241 --> 00:42:58.809
- [Michael] Yeah.

00:42:58.809 --> 00:43:00.377
- But if you're gonna tell me
that an eight month abortion,

00:43:00.377 --> 00:43:02.846
just because someone
feels like it, is okay.

00:43:02.846 --> 00:43:03.781
- It's crazy.

00:43:03.781 --> 00:43:05.215
- What can I do, what can I do?

00:43:05.215 --> 00:43:08.352 align:start size:97% position:3%
- And talk about using
every tool available to us,

00:43:08.352 --> 00:43:09.853
you know, we were talking
