00:43:12.389 --> 00:43:15.125 align:start size:88% position:13%
I think the
philosophical arguments

00:43:15.125 --> 00:43:17.595 align:start size:84% position:16%
for abortion are
extraordinarily weak.

00:43:17.595 --> 00:43:19.897 align:start size:97% position:3%
I don't think there are
